@WebAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5280

GET {{WebAPI_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### Inscription
POST http://localhost:5280/api/account/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "client@test.com", "password": "Client12345", "displayName": "Client Test" }

### Connexion admin (compte seedé)
POST http://localhost:5280/api/account/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@shop.local", "password": "Admin12345" }

### Profil (collez le token reçu)
GET http://localhost:5280/api/account/me
Authorization: Bearer COLLEZ_LE_TOKEN_ICI
